Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 23:00:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/14] Add object-scoped Case graveyard casting

Snapshot GenericEffect recipients at resolution and route their GraveyardCastPermission modes through the graveyard casting collector. Pin each recipient incarnation so a later object at the same id cannot inherit the permission.

Anchors: GenericEffect recipient broadcasting in game/effects/effect.rs; player-scoped transient graveyard permission collection in game/casting.rs (Yawgmoth's Will); AddStaticMode materialization in game/layers.rs.

Runtime: case_of_the_uneaten_feast_grants_only_to_resolution_time_graveyard_creatures. Parser: kethis_and_case_of_the_uneaten_feast_recognize_optional_cast_permissions.
